 intro_lead:'On Placentines, a few steps from the Giralda, long conversations, well-chosen wines and a kitchen that looks to Seville and to the world live side by side.',
 intro_p1:'Pelayo —half painter, half writer— imagined a bar where people and stories matter as much as what reaches the table. A house of blends, encounters and curiosity.',
 intro_p2:'Calle Placentines still echoes with the Italian merchants of the 15th century. And it leaves a question hanging over its stones: <strong>where would the Giraldillo fall?</strong>',
 intro_link:'Step into Pelayo',cap_street:'PLACENTINES · THE GIRALDA BEYOND',cap_facade:'PELAYO’S FAÇADE',
