 k2a:'02 / THREE WORLDS',k2b:'ONE HOUSE',spaces_title:'Three spaces.<br><em>One heartbeat.</em>',spaces_sub:'There isn’t just one Pelayo. There are different ways to sit down, look around and let the night unfold.',
 space1_tag:'01 — THE STREET',space1_title:'The terrace',space1_text:'On Calle Placentines, a few steps from the Giralda. The city passes right by your table.',
 space2_tag:'02 — THE BODEGA',space2_title:'The bullring-bodega room',space2_text:'Wooden beams, barrels and the air of a bullfighting bodega, with an unexpected nod to Blade Runner.',
 space3_tag:'03 — THE OTHER CITY',space3_title:'The avant-garde room',space3_text:'Nods to New York, portraits, multicoloured light and the feel of another city inside Seville.',
